3:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Memory:"}]," Visitors remember how you made them feel. Confusing navigation, too many form fields, vague headlines-these stick. Retargeting brings them back to the same experience."]}]
4:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Intent:"}]," A clear first page creates clear intent. Visitors know what you offer and whether it's for them. Retargeting then serves as a nudge, not a rescue mission."]}]
5:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Segment retargeting by drop-off point, not just by \"visited\""}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A single \"all site visitors\" retargeting audience treats a visitor who bounced in two seconds the same as one who reached checkout and abandoned. Those are different problems and need different pages:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Bounced in under 10 seconds:"}]," The message-match gap is the likely cause - retarget with the original ad's exact headline restated, not a discount."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Scrolled but didn't engage the CTA:"}]," The proof or objection-handling further down the page didn't land - retarget to a page section, not the homepage."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"Started checkout or a form, then left:"}]," This is genuine purchase intent that stalled on friction - retarget with a direct link back into the same step, not a new landing page."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Sending all three segments to the same generic retargeting creative and the same homepage is the most common reason retargeting spend underperforms cold prospecting - it treats three distinct leaks as one."}]]}]
